    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/edoworks/rung/zipball/v0.3.2",
    "body": "# Rung 0.3.2\n\nRelease scope: move public discovery to the verified Edoworks static project\npage and make the Rung artifact contract explicit. This release does not\ndepend on the former laptop-hosted web distribution.\n\n## Included\n\n- Canonical project page at `https://edoworks.com/rung/`.\n- Free MIT-licensed Python package and dependency-free standalone CLI.\n- Release-path guard rejecting container-runtime dependencies in executable\n  release metadata and scripts.\n- Reproducible wheel, source distribution, and standalone artifact validation.\n\n## Limits\n\nRung remains an assessment aid, not certification, compliance advice,\nenforcement proof, or release approval. The former `rung.edoworks.com` origin\nis not required by the artifacts and remains a separate hosting incident until\nthe owner retires or redirects it.\n"
  },
